 "definitions": "TRIAGE rebuttal E4 readout: ReCogDrive-2B fixed-recipe (vision LoRA\ntrains) RQ2 crop fine-tune, all numbers from the Pro 6000.\n\nDefinitions are ER4's (scripts/101 assemble_er4), unchanged:\n  pooled E_s(v)   = sum_city mean_l2_at_2s * n / sum_city n, stratum s in\n                    {all, turn, straight}; L2 between plan point at 2 s and\n                    the human 2-s position; turning = |dyaw(2 s)| >= 15 deg\n  repair_turn     = E_turn(zero-shot native) - E_turn(adapted native)\n  residual_turn   = E_turn(adapted crop k)   - E_turn(adapted native)\n  damage_turn     = E_turn(zero-shot crop k) - E_turn(zero-shot native)\n  compensation    = 1 - residual_turn / damage_turn (only if damage >= 0.10)\n  E_R4_1, E_R4_2, E_R4_3 rules verbatim.",
